OL,3,AHomes and temples glow across India to
OL,4,Amark Diwali
OL,5,
OL,6,FMillions across India are celebrating
OL,7,FDiwali, the Hindu festival of lights,
OL,8,Filluminating homes, temples, offices
OL,9,Fand streets with oil lamps and
OL,10,Fcolourful lights to symbolise the
OL,11,Ftriumph of light over darkness.
OL,13,FThe festival falls on the darkest night
OL,14,Fof the Hindu lunar month of Kartik,
OL,15,Fwhen the moon is not visible in the
OL,16,Fsky.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
